s11 DKO, so independent of the RGS anchoring in Model A gomodel:6ab067da00008260; Fig. 3 direct interaction) and Orlandi 2013 PMID:24114537 (human GPR179 x mouse TRPM1 co-IP; PLA in retina). Mouse data -> ISS GO_REF:0000024 with MGI. Data are from rod bipolar cells; ON-bipolar cell CL:0000749 used to match Model A and the mega-viewer. Joins Model A and gomodel:6a6ba88c00000472 at TRPM1."}, {"key": "https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/in_taxon", "value": "NCBITaxon:9606", "value-type": "IRI"}]}